WEBVTT

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:09.170
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:32.610 --> 00:01:34.620
The Unparalleled Scholar Noodles

00:01:34.670 --> 00:01:36.580
that I made before the deadline passed!

00:01:36.880 --> 00:01:37.640
That's great.

00:01:37.750 --> 00:01:39.690
I thought I was a Super Chef.

00:01:39.960 --> 00:01:40.890
But I never knew

00:01:41.010 --> 00:01:43.010
that's just a preliminary test.

00:01:43.830 --> 00:01:45.890
Later five eligible cooks

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:47.620
(Noodle)
would have an official test.

00:01:47.860 --> 00:01:49.920
(Not)
It'll be held on the legendary Cooking Arena.

00:01:50.660 --> 00:01:53.110
(Noodle No Flour)
The official test's theme is much harder.

00:01:53.760 --> 00:01:55.840
The cuisine should both be and not be noodles.

00:01:56.520 --> 00:01:58.790
What I choose...

00:02:02.220 --> 00:02:04.870
You see, we need to make noodle
which is not made from flour.

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:07.460
This is my answer.

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:08.710
Is it catfish?

00:02:11.150 --> 00:02:14.690
A Fateful Rival Appears: Talented Young Chef Fei

00:02:18.240 --> 00:02:21.680
(Noodle No Flour)

00:02:33.870 --> 00:02:34.960
We need to make cuisine

00:02:35.010 --> 00:02:36.130
which is noodle but not made from flour.

00:02:36.180 --> 00:02:37.700
Why do I choose catfish?

00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:40.010
Because it

00:02:40.060 --> 00:02:41.250
can be anything.

00:02:41.370 --> 00:02:42.320
Anything?

00:02:51.470 --> 00:02:54.730
You see, although it contains much fat,

00:02:54.980 --> 00:02:56.690
it tastes mild without smell of fish.

00:02:56.790 --> 00:02:58.300
And it doesn't

00:02:58.350 --> 00:02:59.920
have smell of mud which is peculiar to river fish.

00:03:00.010 --> 00:03:02.310
So it can be cuisine in any form.

00:03:02.440 --> 00:03:04.570
It's not a civet cat or a fox.

00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:07.000
How can it become noodles?

00:03:07.790 --> 00:03:09.100
Mao, what are you thinking?

00:03:09.150 --> 00:03:10.650
I don't understand.

00:03:15.570 --> 00:03:17.360
The cuisine should both be and not be noodles.

00:03:18.520 --> 00:03:19.390
Interesting.

00:03:19.820 --> 00:03:21.460
The title of Super Chef

00:03:21.540 --> 00:03:23.510
must belong to me, Han.

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:35.180
It's awesome!

00:03:44.030 --> 00:03:46.290
So-called cuisine is the magic of food.

00:03:46.930 --> 00:03:48.550
I'll show you

00:03:48.650 --> 00:03:51.670
the power of Ryuuri Witch Che Lin from Guangzhou.

00:04:20.430 --> 00:04:21.830
He only uses thumb.

00:04:22.320 --> 00:04:22.950
I see.

00:04:23.290 --> 00:04:24.550
At that time he was...

00:04:47.290 --> 00:04:47.860
Mao,

00:04:47.990 --> 00:04:50.040
Why are you playing?

00:04:50.120 --> 00:04:51.600
I'm not playing.

00:04:52.130 --> 00:04:53.600
You put the spoon up

00:04:53.660 --> 00:04:54.470
and move here.

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:57.010
Is that OK?

00:04:57.260 --> 00:04:58.200
A little higher.

00:04:59.170 --> 00:04:59.830
Like this?

00:05:00.550 --> 00:05:01.380
All right.

00:05:01.510 --> 00:05:02.220
I'll start!

00:05:07.170 --> 00:05:08.350
It's like a magic.

00:05:08.920 --> 00:05:09.670
I know.

00:05:09.770 --> 00:05:11.280
You want to mix yolk up with fish paste,

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:12.160
right?

00:05:14.430 --> 00:05:16.720
I choose egg white.

00:05:16.770 --> 00:05:18.590
Its mild taste

00:05:18.890 --> 00:05:20.640
can make the refreshing texture of catfish stand out.

00:05:24.190 --> 00:05:26.680
Well, it's enough.

00:05:27.060 --> 00:05:28.360
The next is liquor.

00:05:29.410 --> 00:05:31.220
What is it used for?

00:05:31.590 --> 00:05:32.950
Let me explain it for you.

00:05:32.990 --> 00:05:34.500
(Illustration of Cuisine)

00:05:36.420 --> 00:05:37.510
Pour the liquor

00:05:37.740 --> 00:05:39.310
into a boiling pot,

00:05:39.540 --> 00:05:42.160
evaporate extra water and alcohol

00:05:42.520 --> 00:05:43.660
and leave the flavour of liquor.

00:05:43.710 --> 00:05:46.000
Add it into the bowl as base before I make noodles.

00:05:46.430 --> 00:05:47.540
Base?

00:05:48.950 --> 00:05:50.050
The flavour of noodles

00:05:50.230 --> 00:05:52.140
is just the flavour of cereal.

00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:55.080
Liquor is made from cereal.

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:58.340
And this is why I choose it as base.

00:05:58.430 --> 00:05:59.940
It's almost done.

00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:02.430
Mao,

00:06:02.520 --> 00:06:04.000
there're some holes on the cloth.

00:06:05.060 --> 00:06:06.000
What are you going to do?

00:06:06.620 --> 00:06:07.950
Just wait and see.

00:06:25.690 --> 00:06:27.710
First, the dough is successful!

00:06:30.380 --> 00:06:31.750
Great!

00:06:32.150 --> 00:06:33.110
Although I haven't boiled it,

00:06:33.230 --> 00:06:34.680
you can have a taste.

00:06:35.590 --> 00:06:36.670
But...

00:06:37.360 --> 00:06:39.820
It looks nice to be so white.

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:03.170
Is this really...

00:07:03.540 --> 00:07:04.970
So refreshing!

00:07:05.210 --> 00:07:06.660
Smell of fish

00:07:06.720 --> 00:07:07.980
and smell of mud peculiar to river fish

00:07:08.030 --> 00:07:09.290
are totally gone.

00:07:12.510 --> 00:07:13.580
It has proper fat,

00:07:13.630 --> 00:07:14.440
cool taste.

00:07:15.030 --> 00:07:16.120
The flavour

00:07:16.170 --> 00:07:17.230
spreading in my mouth...

00:07:18.020 --> 00:07:20.620
I see. It's out of the liquor you sprinkled at last.

00:07:20.980 --> 00:07:22.440
It has no smell of flour

00:07:22.490 --> 00:07:24.860
which other food out of four will have.

00:07:24.990 --> 00:07:26.640
It tastes better than common noodles.

00:07:27.110 --> 00:07:29.370
It's utterly in line with

00:07:29.450 --> 00:07:30.160
the theme of noodles not made from flour.

00:07:38.360 --> 00:07:39.150
What do you think?

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:41.540
What's wrong with you,

00:07:41.710 --> 00:07:42.430
Mao?

00:07:54.400 --> 00:07:57.070
What's up?

00:07:58.500 --> 00:08:00.900
It has no flavour at all.

00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:02.240
What are you saying?

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:04.030
It tastes really good.

00:08:04.460 --> 00:08:07.070
No, my tongue is strange.

00:08:07.260 --> 00:08:09.610
It feels nothing.

00:08:10.100 --> 00:08:11.040
How could it be?

00:08:11.200 --> 00:08:12.980
I don't know.

00:08:13.030 --> 00:08:13.810
Everyone

00:08:13.870 --> 00:08:16.210
is making their cuisine smoothly.

00:08:16.730 --> 00:08:17.830
What can we do?

00:08:21.990 --> 00:08:23.130
I don't know.

00:08:23.730 --> 00:08:25.800
I can't taste no matter what I eat.

00:08:26.220 --> 00:08:28.500
I lose my sense of taste completely...

00:08:28.880 --> 00:08:30.230
How come?

00:08:31.090 --> 00:08:32.410
At such a crucial time,

00:08:32.460 --> 00:08:33.870
how could it be?

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:37.110
Tongue is Mao's most powerful weapon.

00:08:37.230 --> 00:08:39.610
If Mao lost taste sense, everything would be over.

00:08:40.460 --> 00:08:41.680
How did this happen?

00:08:41.810 --> 00:08:43.830
It took a lot to make such great noodles.

00:08:43.880 --> 00:08:44.890
Why?

00:08:44.940 --> 00:08:46.250
I can't believe.

00:08:46.300 --> 00:08:47.140
Mao,

00:08:48.420 --> 00:08:49.860
open your mouth.

00:08:56.170 --> 00:08:57.570
What are you doing?

00:08:57.710 --> 00:08:58.800
You're out of line.

00:08:59.030 --> 00:09:00.820
What do you put in Mao's mouth?

00:09:01.400 --> 00:09:03.060
How are you feeling?
Do you get your sense of taste back?

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:06.860
What are you doing?

00:09:06.910 --> 00:09:08.180
Don't be so rude.

00:09:22.320 --> 00:09:23.400
It's too salty.

00:09:23.900 --> 00:09:27.500
Is this my sister's rock salt?

00:09:27.810 --> 00:09:29.990
Fei, how could you?

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:30.840
Too salty.

00:09:36.330 --> 00:09:37.150
Well,

00:09:37.650 --> 00:09:39.140
my sense of taste comes back.

00:09:39.420 --> 00:09:41.110
That's great, Mao!

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:43.860
I'm saved!

00:09:47.070 --> 00:09:48.560
I'm so relieved.

00:09:49.910 --> 00:09:50.550
What?

00:09:50.970 --> 00:09:53.320
This was on your neck just now.

00:09:55.990 --> 00:09:56.600
A needle.

00:09:57.440 --> 00:09:58.400
The control center of taste sense

00:09:58.450 --> 00:10:00.430
is behind your ear.

00:10:01.050 --> 00:10:02.660
When the needle is inserted in,

00:10:03.190 --> 00:10:04.550
your taste

00:10:04.600 --> 00:10:05.390
will be numbed temporarily.

00:10:06.060 --> 00:10:07.570
Where is it from?

00:10:08.200 --> 00:10:08.880
I'm afraid

00:10:10.110 --> 00:10:11.990
someone here

00:10:12.290 --> 00:10:14.200
pricked it in while you didn’t notice.

00:10:15.820 --> 00:10:16.540
He went too far!

00:10:16.590 --> 00:10:17.750
Who is he?

00:10:18.050 --> 00:10:19.300
I don't know.

00:10:19.780 --> 00:10:21.240
But I can tell you,

00:10:21.880 --> 00:10:22.860
for cooks,

00:10:23.340 --> 00:10:24.620
the test of Super Chef

00:10:25.440 --> 00:10:26.410
is a competition

00:10:26.460 --> 00:10:28.070
which they all want to win at all costs.

00:10:28.940 --> 00:10:29.840
Take care.

00:10:30.270 --> 00:10:31.850
You are an easy target.

00:10:32.290 --> 00:10:33.300
Wait, Fei.

00:10:33.710 --> 00:10:35.690
Why are you so kind to me?

00:10:36.060 --> 00:10:36.780
I think

00:10:37.120 --> 00:10:38.770
you really want to win this competition as well.

00:10:38.890 --> 00:10:40.150
Why are you...

00:10:40.580 --> 00:10:41.800
I don't know why.

00:10:42.830 --> 00:10:44.450
But I know that

00:10:47.070 --> 00:10:48.920
I owe

00:10:49.450 --> 00:10:50.980
your mother Chef Pai one.

00:10:51.840 --> 00:10:52.560
Fei

00:10:52.830 --> 00:10:54.580
owes my mother?

00:11:01.320 --> 00:11:02.910
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:11:09.450 --> 00:11:10.770
You owe my mother.

00:11:11.330 --> 00:11:13.470
Did you know my mother before?

00:11:16.290 --> 00:11:18.700
You say you don't know why.

00:11:18.970 --> 00:11:20.200
But who don't know himself?

00:11:20.980 --> 00:11:23.390
I don't remember the details of my childhood.

00:11:26.050 --> 00:11:26.580
But...

00:11:29.480 --> 00:11:33.230
(Huayang Restaurant)

00:11:38.840 --> 00:11:40.490
I can't wait to grow up.

00:11:40.830 --> 00:11:41.760
I want to be a cook

00:11:41.810 --> 00:11:42.930
as terrific as my father.

00:11:42.980 --> 00:11:43.800
I want you to be proud of me.

00:11:44.310 --> 00:11:46.220
Fei, it's really hard to learn to cook.

00:11:46.560 --> 00:11:47.720
I don't care.

00:11:48.280 --> 00:11:49.880
Fei, you are

00:11:49.990 --> 00:11:50.850
too naive.

00:11:57.310 --> 00:11:58.860
Who are you?

00:11:59.140 --> 00:12:00.180
What are you going to do?

00:12:02.140 --> 00:12:02.590
Fei!

00:12:03.060 --> 00:12:04.460
Father, mother!

00:12:04.600 --> 00:12:05.300
What do you want?

00:12:05.400 --> 00:12:05.960
Wait!

00:12:12.180 --> 00:12:12.960
What's wrong with you?

00:12:13.260 --> 00:12:14.390
Fei, are you OK?

00:12:30.880 --> 00:12:34.010
I'm scared. Help!

00:12:35.780 --> 00:12:36.820
Be quite.

00:13:01.150 --> 00:13:02.290
Listen,

00:13:02.850 --> 00:13:04.090
I won't forgive you

00:13:04.140 --> 00:13:06.220
if you drop the pot.

00:13:16.520 --> 00:13:17.100
Are you OK? Come on!

00:13:20.100 --> 00:13:22.100
How dare you interfere with her business?

00:13:22.380 --> 00:13:23.870
You two will be punished together.

00:13:29.810 --> 00:13:31.950
Are you a fool? Is it eatable?

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:33.910
Remake it now!

00:13:40.910 --> 00:13:42.400
The experience of making cuisine there

00:13:42.790 --> 00:13:44.870
had been the most terrible memory for me.

00:13:47.730 --> 00:13:49.330
Even so,

00:13:49.820 --> 00:13:50.730
I had

00:13:50.780 --> 00:13:52.370
some happy time

00:13:54.920 --> 00:13:58.010
when I met her.

00:14:20.330 --> 00:14:22.360
Father, mother!

00:14:31.270 --> 00:14:33.300
What's wrong with you? Cheer up!

00:14:51.360 --> 00:14:52.360
You're awake!

00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:56.950
Well, drink this.

00:14:57.740 --> 00:14:59.480
When you feel cold, hungry and tired,

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:01.040
You'd better

00:15:01.170 --> 00:15:02.290
drink this kind of soup

00:15:02.340 --> 00:15:03.180
to warm you up.

00:15:10.340 --> 00:15:11.110
This is...

00:15:17.890 --> 00:15:19.740
What amazes me is that

00:15:19.790 --> 00:15:21.570
soup's flavour spreads through my body at once

00:15:22.680 --> 00:15:24.590
and I regain my strength.

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:36.770
This is the first time I taste such delicious soup.

00:15:37.140 --> 00:15:38.000
This soup...

00:15:38.960 --> 00:15:40.390
You look better.

00:15:40.810 --> 00:15:41.700
That's good.

00:15:41.920 --> 00:15:42.880
I'm relieved.

00:15:46.150 --> 00:15:46.750
Excuse me.

00:15:47.060 --> 00:15:47.700
What?

00:15:48.030 --> 00:15:48.990
I wonder

00:15:49.160 --> 00:15:49.770
is there any special medicine

00:15:49.820 --> 00:15:51.670
in this soup?

00:15:52.120 --> 00:15:52.820
Well,

00:15:53.230 --> 00:15:54.260
it's not medicine.

00:15:54.420 --> 00:15:56.000
To add flavour,

00:15:56.200 --> 00:15:58.170
I put some herbs good for health in it.

00:15:58.230 --> 00:15:59.240
Herbs?

00:16:05.180 --> 00:16:05.820
Look at yourself.

00:16:06.250 --> 00:16:07.450
Take your time.

00:16:07.500 --> 00:16:08.380
It's not good.

00:16:14.810 --> 00:16:16.120
Drink it slowly.

00:16:18.310 --> 00:16:19.720
It was just a soup.

00:16:20.380 --> 00:16:22.030
But it warmed

00:16:22.070 --> 00:16:23.270
my cold body and soul.

00:16:24.440 --> 00:16:25.040
So

00:16:26.080 --> 00:16:27.520
cuisine should not only be delicious

00:16:27.910 --> 00:16:29.340
but also bring happiness.

00:16:30.120 --> 00:16:31.560
I understand this

00:16:32.000 --> 00:16:34.380
just because your mother, Chef Pai.

00:16:37.110 --> 00:16:38.510
I keep that night

00:16:38.850 --> 00:16:40.330
fresh in my memory.

00:16:41.540 --> 00:16:42.170
For me,

00:16:42.220 --> 00:16:43.160
it's the most important and the only memory

00:16:43.390 --> 00:16:44.820
in my mind.

00:16:46.000 --> 00:16:46.520
Who

00:16:46.570 --> 00:16:48.230
trafficked you?

00:16:48.620 --> 00:16:49.750
How did you escape from it?

00:16:51.470 --> 00:16:52.730
I never knew

00:16:52.780 --> 00:16:54.350
Mao's mother saved you.

00:16:54.600 --> 00:16:56.140
It's a kind of fate.

00:16:57.210 --> 00:16:59.420
But I won't treat you

00:16:59.470 --> 00:17:01.320
as Chef Pai's son.

00:17:01.860 --> 00:17:03.120
You have the ability

00:17:03.170 --> 00:17:04.380
to create Unparalleled Scholar Noodles.

00:17:04.780 --> 00:17:06.090
So you are the same as others.

00:17:06.370 --> 00:17:07.170
You're my opponent

00:17:07.220 --> 00:17:08.890
in the competition for the honor of Super Chef.

00:17:09.140 --> 00:17:11.970
No, you are the enemy I must defeat.

00:17:12.370 --> 00:17:12.990
Fei?

00:17:13.950 --> 00:17:14.680
From now on,

00:17:15.100 --> 00:17:16.790
let's compete with each other

00:17:17.130 --> 00:17:19.980
as cooks, Mao.

00:17:20.470 --> 00:17:21.000
Fei,

00:17:23.020 --> 00:17:24.300
I take your challenge.

00:17:33.090 --> 00:17:34.780
It escapes again. So irritating.

00:17:36.100 --> 00:17:36.690
It's bad.

00:17:36.960 --> 00:17:38.590
I must make it this time.

00:17:39.770 --> 00:17:40.680
It doesn't work.

00:17:42.990 --> 00:17:44.470
Mao, what are you doing?

00:17:44.580 --> 00:17:45.530
You are catching fish again.

00:17:46.010 --> 00:17:47.380
This is...

00:17:47.470 --> 00:17:48.490
This is pagrus major.

00:17:49.530 --> 00:17:52.040
Yes, king of sea fish, pagrus major.

00:17:52.560 --> 00:17:53.160
This time,

00:17:53.240 --> 00:17:55.140
do you want to make noodles out of it again?

00:17:55.600 --> 00:17:56.910
It's for soup.

00:17:58.850 --> 00:17:59.930
Let's start.

00:18:09.260 --> 00:18:11.470
Make soup slowly with the bones of fish head and tail.

00:18:11.710 --> 00:18:13.110
Roll the fish up.

00:18:15.290 --> 00:18:16.880
In case it disperses when boiled,

00:18:17.830 --> 00:18:19.140
I tie it up with the kite strings.

00:18:19.620 --> 00:18:20.700
Then mix it up with fish seasoning of

00:18:20.750 --> 00:18:22.740
Sichuan specialty brought by my sister,
which is marinated from

00:18:22.790 --> 00:18:25.390
all kinds of freshwater fish like prussian carp.

00:18:26.680 --> 00:18:27.730
It's fish again.

00:18:29.170 --> 00:18:31.160
Sichuan is far from the sea.

00:18:31.270 --> 00:18:32.810
It's hard for people there to eat some seafood.

00:18:33.100 --> 00:18:34.380
In order to add some flavour of seafood

00:18:34.420 --> 00:18:35.920
on dishes,

00:18:35.970 --> 00:18:37.130
they invent such a kind of unique seasoning.

00:18:37.720 --> 00:18:38.870
Stewing the rolled pagrus major

00:18:38.940 --> 00:18:40.790
with this fish seasoning.

00:18:42.310 --> 00:18:43.290
And then

00:18:43.340 --> 00:18:44.240
add it

00:18:44.290 --> 00:18:45.110
into the soup.

00:18:47.040 --> 00:18:49.070
It's done.

00:18:50.560 --> 00:18:52.780
Next we just need to boil the catfish noodles.

00:19:02.330 --> 00:19:03.840
Are you finished?

00:19:03.970 --> 00:19:05.020
One thing left,

00:19:13.550 --> 00:19:14.640
we need to cut the rolled pagrus major

00:19:14.690 --> 00:19:15.610
into pieces

00:19:21.110 --> 00:19:22.510
and put them onto noodles.

00:19:22.950 --> 00:19:23.740
It's finished.

00:19:28.740 --> 00:19:29.520
The noodles should be so good

00:19:29.570 --> 00:19:31.560
just with fish.

00:19:32.240 --> 00:19:33.250
Can I have a taste?

00:19:33.440 --> 00:19:34.450
Of course.

00:19:38.650 --> 00:19:39.180
How is it?

00:19:41.030 --> 00:19:42.600
Very delicious.

00:19:42.650 --> 00:19:47.310
(Yummy)

00:19:48.130 --> 00:19:49.000
You must win

00:19:49.050 --> 00:19:50.730
with it.

00:19:50.810 --> 00:19:52.420
You're so great, Mao!

00:19:52.470 --> 00:19:53.210
Nice!

00:19:53.490 --> 00:19:54.730
Well, let me try.

00:19:55.770 --> 00:19:57.230
How does it taste? Is it delicious?

00:20:00.270 --> 00:20:01.280
What's up, Mao?

00:20:01.800 --> 00:20:02.560
We're in trouble.

00:20:04.400 --> 00:20:07.050
It has a fatal weakness.

00:20:08.660 --> 00:20:10.680
It tastes refreshing.

00:20:11.060 --> 00:20:13.230
But what is the most important is the texture of noodles.

00:20:13.270 --> 00:20:14.410
It's not chewy at all.

00:20:17.790 --> 00:20:19.210
All in all,

00:20:19.260 --> 00:20:19.960
it's made from soft catfish.

00:20:20.670 --> 00:20:22.340
We can't change it.

00:20:22.910 --> 00:20:24.530
Not necessarily.

00:20:25.090 --> 00:20:25.990
As I imagined,

00:20:26.260 --> 00:20:28.640
it should be chewier.

00:20:29.270 --> 00:20:30.670
If so, I won't win.

00:20:31.000 --> 00:20:31.800
How could it be?

00:20:32.230 --> 00:20:33.280
But we have no time

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:34.660
to remake it.

00:20:34.970 --> 00:20:37.470
No, I won't give up the catfish noodles.

00:20:37.790 --> 00:20:39.250
How can you

00:20:39.300 --> 00:20:40.500
make it chewier?

00:20:40.940 --> 00:20:42.530
Do you have any idea?

00:20:42.580 --> 00:20:43.280
Mao?

00:20:58.150 --> 00:20:59.370
Time is nearly up.

00:20:59.510 --> 00:21:01.640
Everyone is going to finish their cuisine.

00:21:01.970 --> 00:21:03.970
What will you do, Mao?

00:21:05.250 --> 00:21:06.060
I won't

00:21:06.110 --> 00:21:07.820
let Fei down.

00:21:09.100 --> 00:21:09.710
And...

00:21:11.030 --> 00:21:11.820
From now on,

00:21:12.020 --> 00:21:13.710
let's compete with each other

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:17.060
as cooks, Mao.

00:21:20.290 --> 00:21:22.930
Fei, I won't lose to you.

00:21:23.420 --> 00:21:25.910
I will finish it.

00:21:27.320 --> 00:21:27.970
But,

00:21:29.750 --> 00:21:31.310
how can noodles be chewier?

00:21:32.800 --> 00:21:34.460
I will work it out.

00:21:35.100 --> 00:21:36.620
I will.

00:23:14.970 --> 00:23:17.250
Preview of the next episode

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:17.253
Preview of the next episode
I did what I had to do.

00:23:17.253 --> 00:23:19.320
I did what I had to do.

00:23:19.320 --> 00:23:21.173
Everyone's cooking is great,

00:23:21.173 --> 00:23:22.608
but I'm no slouch either.

00:23:22.692 --> 00:23:24.694
If my calculation is correct,

00:23:24.770 --> 00:23:26.840
these noodles will have a firm texture.

00:23:26.840 --> 00:23:28.072
Let's do it!

00:23:28.406 --> 00:23:30.200
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:30.200 --> 00:23:32.952
Catfish Noodles Done Judgment of Fate

00:23:32.952 --> 00:23:34.913
It will definitely be interesting!
